We've finally had some time to start merging in the volunteer-contributed code
for the new scoreboard (at
<http://nethack.devnull.net/cgi-bin/tournament/scoreboard.pl>).  It's taking
longer and longer to calculate, so we'll try to get the cached web page back in
place soon.

At the moment, all of the Recognition tropies are finished.  Please note that
the code for some of the higher-level Recognition Trophies _theoretically
works, but we're not certain, since no one's achieved them yet.

It looks like we may have finally found a trophy structure that'll leave Marvin
something further to shoot for next year, though (as another thread has pointed
out) seeing him miss the Grand Slam With Bells On in the _last_ of the minimum
13 games is kinda painful.

Please check you entries and let us know if something's not calculating
properly.

